WEBVTT

00:03:59.852 --> 00:04:03.055
Vi taler meget omkring de her
jamsessioner og alting.

00:04:03.079 --> 00:04:04.229
EC: Ja.

00:04:04.253 --> 00:04:08.750
NC: Skal vi ikke give dem et lille glimt,
bare en smule, af en jamsession?

00:04:08.774 --> 00:04:12.316
NP: Vil I alle høre en jamsession?
EC: Er I alle klar til en jamsession?

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.341
(Jubel)

00:04:13.365 --> 00:04:14.710
NP: Undskyld, var det et ja?

00:04:14.734 --> 00:04:15.735
(Jubel)

00:04:15.759 --> 00:04:16.910
Ja! Giv los, farmand!

00:04:16.934 --> 00:04:19.576
(Beatboxing)